    "content": "<p>Versatile Full-Stack Software Engineer (Java/React)&nbsp;with a strong background in automated testing, CI/CD integration, and cloud deployments.&nbsp;Combines full-stack development expertise with digital marketing experience&nbsp;to build scalable e-commerce platforms and automated data-driven tools.</p>"
