          "website": {
            "url": "",
            "label": ""
          },
          "description": "<p>Cross-Platform Digital Marketing Tool | 01/2023 – Present</p><ul><li><p>Developing a robust full-stack application utilizing React Native, a Java backend, and a PostgreSQL database.</p></li><li><p>Automating advertising workflows by integrating with Google Ads, Meta, TikTok, and Snapchat APIs.</p></li><li><p>Implementing Test-Driven Development (TDD) principles alongside automated UI and API testing, seamlessly integrated into CI/CD workflows.</p></li></ul><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" href=\"https://www.ahsaphome.com/\">Ahsap Home (E-commerce Platform)</a> | 02/2024 – 02/2026</p><ul><li><p>Developed and launched a secure e-commerce platform using React for the frontend and Java with Spring Boot for the backend.</p></li><li><p>Integrated the Iyzico 3D Secure Payment system to ensure safe and reliable transaction processing.</p></li><li><p>Optimized application performance and reduced data retrieval times by implementing Redis caching strategies.</p></li><li><p>Automated backend and API testing using JUnit and RestAssured, integrating these suites into CI/CD pipelines to ensure code quality.</p></li><li><p>Managed infrastructure by deploying via Docker on AWS EC2, later migrating to a VDS, while enhancing availability and security with Nginx and Cloudflare.</p></li></ul><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" href=\"https://mayavox.com/\">Mayavox</a> &amp; <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" href=\"https://www.mayapex.com/\">Mayapex</a> (Voice Over / Digital Media Agency Platforms) | 04/2023 – 04/2025</p><ul><li><p>Designed and implemented full-stack applications utilizing React and Java with Spring Boot to deliver a seamless user experience.</p></li><li><p>Developed secure authentication and built an intuitive platform allowing clients to browse voice samples and submit offers.</p></li><li><p>Integrated JMS asynchronous messaging to facilitate instant email notifications for administrators upon offer submissions.</p></li><li><p>Ensured system reliability by writing automated testing processes using JUnit, Selenium WebDriver, and RestAssured.<br></p></li></ul><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" href=\"https://www.influencerhomie.com/\">Influencer Homie</a></p><ul><li><p>Built a data-driven web application integrated with the Amazon Product API to automate coupon retrieval.</p></li><li><p>Implemented a Selenium WebDriver-based scraper to extract JavaScript-rendered coupons from affiliate portals and route structured data to the Java backend.</p></li><li><p>Persisted data efficiently in PostgreSQL using Hibernate with clean DTO-entity mapping architecture.</p></li></ul><p></p>",
          "roles": []
        }
      ]
    },
